---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import DecisionGraphic from "../components/DecisionGraphic.astro";
import "../styles/home.css";
import { site } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout home>
  <div class="site-shell editorial-home">
    <section class="home-intro" aria-labelledby="home-title">
      <div class="home-intro__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Marketing analytics &amp; growth measurement</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">I lead marketing analytics at Lark Health.</h1>
        <p class="home-intro__dek">
          I build attribution models and enrollment forecasts used to plan
          marketing spend. I also develop the data systems and reporting
          the team relies on.
        </p>
        <div class="home-intro__actions">
          <a class="button-primary" href="#selected-work">View my work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href={site.resume} download>Résumé <span class="link-detail">PDF · one page</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="home-portrait">
        <img
          src="/images/derek-shirley-photo.jpg"
          alt="Derek Shirley"
          width="800"
          height="800"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <span>Based in Dallas–Fort Worth</span>
          <span>Working remotely</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="selected-stories" id="selected-work" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2 class="eyebrow" id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
      </div>

      <article class="lead-story">
        <div class="lead-story__copy">
          <p class="story-context">Lark Health <span>Attribution</span></p>
          <h3><a href="/work/lark-attribution">Correcting direct-mail attribution</a></h3>
          <p>
            Direct mail, a channel with <strong>$550K in annual spend</strong>,
            was going to be discontinued. I rebuilt the acquisition
            measurement, recovered its attributed enrollments, and reversed
            that decision.
          </p>
          <p class="lead-story__support">
            Across the trailing 365-day view around March 2026, unknown
            enrollment attribution also fell from about <strong>42% to 8%</strong>.
          </p>
          <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/work/lark-attribution">Read the attribution case <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <DecisionGraphic kind="attribution" />
      </article>

      <div class="supporting-stories">
        <article class="supporting-story">
          <div class="supporting-story__copy">
            <p class="story-context">Dave &amp; Buster’s <span>Investment planning</span></p>
            <h3><a href="/work/dnb-marketing-ecosystem">A $6.9M Q4 budget recommendation</a></h3>
            <p>
              On a three-hour deadline, I built the media-contribution model
              used to recommend a $6.9M Q4 budget to the CEO and CMO.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/work/dnb-marketing-ecosystem">Read the planning case <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <DecisionGraphic kind="budget" />
        </article>

        <article class="supporting-story">
          <div class="supporting-story__copy">
            <p class="story-context">Lark Health <span>Enrollment forecasting</span></p>
            <h3><a href="/work/lark-enrollment-forecasting">Enrollment forecasts for three Lark partners</a></h3>
            <p>
              I built and shipped forecasts for Carelon, BCBSAL, and MMO to
              guide send volumes and direct-mail budgets, with email costs
              considered too.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/work/lark-enrollment-forecasting">Read the forecasting case <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
          <DecisionGraphic kind="forecast" />
        </article>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link arrow-link all-work-link" href="/work">All work &amp; research <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <article class="home-research-project">
        <div>
          <p class="story-context">Independent research <span>In development</span></p>
          <h3><a href="/work/airport-weather">When does weather disrupt an airport?</a></h3>
          <p>A working airport weather explorer, with a study of how much warning forecasts give us about delays and cancellations.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/work/airport-weather">Explore the project <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="home-leadership" aria-labelledby="leadership-title">
      <div class="home-leadership__intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Management experience</p>
        <h2 id="leadership-title">Managing teams and mentoring analysts</h2>
        <p>
          I’ve managed sales teams and established a pricing analytics
          department. I’ve also helped select analysts and trained
          colleagues at several companies.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link arrow-link" href="/experience">Full experience <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <dl class="leadership-evidence">
        <div>
          <dt>Establishing pricing analytics</dt>
          <dd>
            At American Diamond Logistics, I built the department and its data
            stack, selected and trained an internal analyst, and coached
            logistics coordinators. The pricing workflow improved response
            time by about 43% and win rate by about 22%.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Selecting and developing analysts</dt>
          <dd>
            At Dave &amp; Buster’s, I selected and recommended the analyst who
            was hired, then trained the new hire. I’ve
            also coached analysts at GameStop and Lark.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Leading commercial teams</dt>
          <dd>
            At Park West, I managed up to five salespeople and coordinated
            staff from other departments for art movement and auction setup.
            Today, I’m Lark’s sole owner of marketing analytics.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="home-contact" aria-labelledby="home-contact-title">
      <div>
        <h2 id="home-contact-title">Contact</h2>
        <p>I’m interested in remote roles leading marketing analytics and growth measurement.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-contact__actions">
        <a class="button-primary" href={"mailto:" + site.email}>Email me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="text-link" href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Connect on LinkedIn<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
